  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon paprika",
    "2 teaspoons dry mustard",
    "1 teaspoon cayenne pepper",
    "1 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "1 teaspoon black pepper",
    "1 teaspoon white pepper",
    "1 teaspoon dried thyme",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup unsalted butter, melted, divided",
    "6 (4 ounce) fillets trout"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qha0iCn0YxwpiyAmnil8L9gBY0g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38028-blackened-fish-DDMFS-step-1-295b4265421e4654a734a89f786f1812.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38028/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together paprika, dry mustard, cayenne pepper, cumin, black pepper, white pepper, thyme, and salt in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JN5zWQqHE4hVFyx9e5d9KlSR0H8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38028-blackened-fish-DDMFS-step-2-ba84dea102f94566b0192d014a1b4080.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38028/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a heavy cast iron pan on high heat until extremely hot, about 10 minutes. While the pan is heating, pour 3/4 cup melted butter into a shallow dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b9ndO-0ByE2CYaItY3rEnrZnzfg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38028-blackened-fish-DDMFS-step-3-d946c00cb49f4fa3acc422dae5887725.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38028/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip each fillet into butter, turning once to coat both sides.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x0cRXIXKj_YREJfDCxRSc9MMpGg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38028-blackened-fish-DDMFS-step-4-fd0bd04259434c59b35cdb153c04a316.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38028/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle both sides of fillets with spice mixture; gently pat mixture onto fish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b3V89APFJ7JWvc2lLt341gVez9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38028-blackened-fish-DDMFS-step-5-4fa7520d226a4e9db424d87544a10cfb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38028/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, place fillets into the hot pan without crowding. Carefully pour about 1 teaspoon melted butter over each fillet. Cook until fish has a charred bottom, about 2 minutes. Turn fillets and spoon about 1 teaspoon melted butter over each.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vM8HsnsoSHq3tcIz-_4JaK1NO3Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38028-blackened-fish-DDMFS-step-6-02dc8da648ec45f196e5042a6cca0001.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/38028/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue cooking until bottoms are charred, 1 to 2 minutes. Repeat with remaining fish. Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m3mxh2txfKdid-xgwWDBpGrOvsU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/38028-blackened-fish-DDMFS-4x3-b8d3bc2ff4d1478388cf7605d6ed9c28.jpg"
      ],
